      "id": "CO-118",
      "title": "Widen approval TTL for long-running release windows",
      "description": "Release approvals expire after one hour, which is shorter than a staged production rollout. Operators re-approve mid-rollout, which defeats the point of a bound approval.",
      "project": "HowlChangeOps",
      "priority": "NORMAL",
      "risk_level": "HIGH",
      "task_class": "policy_change",
